      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 560,
        "height": 1108,
        "content": "## AI Writes the Post, Canvora Designs It → Publish to LinkedIn\n\n### How it works\nOn a schedule, an AI model writes one specific LinkedIn post about your topic.\nCanvora turns that concept into a finished, on-brand **LinkedIn visual**, and\nthe workflow **publishes the post + image straight to LinkedIn** — no manual\nstep. Because Canvora returns a hosted image URL, the visual is downloaded and\nattached natively (no separate S3/Cloudinary upload needed).\n\n### Setup steps\n- Create a free Canvora account at canvora.ai — free credits, no card — and\n  copy an API key from Integrations → API Keys (all plans).\n- In each Canvora HTTP Request node, add a **Header Auth** credential:\n  name `X-API-Key`, value your `vd_...` key.\n- Add your OpenAI credential (or swap the node for Claude / Gemini).\n- Connect your LinkedIn credential (personal or organization).\n- Edit \"Set Post Parameters\" — set your topic and optional `brandId`.\n\n### Customization\n- Change the cron in the trigger to your posting cadence.\n- Swap `linkedin_post` for `linkedin_carousel` to publish a multi-slide post\n  (100+ formats: GET https://api.canvora.ai/api/formats).\n- Pass a `brandId` (GET /api/brands) to lock the visual to your brand kit.\n- Prefer human review? Change the LinkedIn node to \"create draft\" or route to\n  a Gmail draft first.\n- Cost: 1 visual = 10 credits per post.\n"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
